  *	  time series using combinations of logarithmic and exponential 
  *       functions
  *
  * DTRF2020 release
  *-----------------
  * - SINEX file per technique with full variance-covariance matrix
  * - EOP file
  * - non-tidal loading displacements as time series per station and component 
  * - residual time series of station positions w.r.t. DTRF2020
  * - translation time series of DTRF2020 origin
  * - Short solution description
